### Describe the bug

I have a complex command with an awk script (given in "to reproduce" section).
Warp do not succeed to execute it, saying that there is a syntax error.
There is no syntax error; I succeed to run it from iTerm.
Since I started to switch to Warp, I'd love to avoid such issue 😉 
Hope you can help me to make it works

### To reproduce

